  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Part
  partName: "Iepl\u016Bdes kolektors"
  description: "T\u0101 galvenais uzdevums ir vienm\u0113r\u012Bgi pievad\u012Bt
    gaisu visiem motora cilindriem. V8 dzin\u0113j\u0101 iepl\u016Bdes kolektors
    atrodas motora centr\u0101 starp ab\u0101m cilindru rind\u0101m un nodro\u0161ina
    gaisa padevi degmais\u012Bjuma sadeg\u0161anai. Kolektora kan\u0101li pal\u012Bdz
    optimiz\u0113t gaisa pl\u016Bsmu, uzlabojot dzin\u0113ja jaudu un griezes momentu."
  logSelection: 1
