  partName: Cilindru galva
  description: "T\u0101s galvenais uzdevums ir nosl\u0113gt cilindrus no aug\u0161puses
    un nodro\u0161in\u0101t vietu svar\u012Bg\u0101m dzin\u0113ja komponent\u0113m,
