  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Part
  partName: Karteris
  description: "T\u0101 galvenais uzdevums ir uzglab\u0101t motore\u013C\u013Cu dzin\u0113ja
    apak\u0161da\u013C\u0101. Karteris sav\u0101c e\u013C\u013Cu p\u0113c t\u0101s
    cirkul\u0101cijas caur motoru, lai e\u013C\u013Cas s\u016Bknis to var\u0113tu
    atk\u0101rtoti padot dzin\u0113ja e\u013C\u013Co\u0161anai. Tas ar\u012B pal\u012Bdz
    dzes\u0113t e\u013C\u013Cu un aizsarg\u0101 motora apak\u0161\u0113j\u0101s komponentes."
  logSelection: 1
